## Generation Rules

- Write from the perspective of a senior SAP {{ "Functional" if doc_type == "FSD" else "Technical" }} Consultant.
- Use structured prose, a table, or a bulleted list — never an unstructured wall of text. Prose paragraphs must not exceed 4–6 sentences.
- Where the input is silent and no clarification was given, record an assumption rather than inventing a requirement.
- Do not ask a question in your response. All clarification for this section was already gathered before this call — if something is still genuinely unresolved, document it as an assumption or an open question in the appropriate register section instead.

## Required Output Format

Respond with ONLY the section body — no "## SECTION_CONTENT:" marker, no repeated
"{{ target_section.number }}. {{ target_section.title }}" heading line, no preamble, no
trailing question.
